<title>GERMANY: Buba data show fall in net reserves week of Aug 31.</title>
<headline>Buba data show fall in net reserves week of Aug 31.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Thursday show that net currency reserves fell to about 103.2 billion marks in the week ending August 31, from about 103.4 billion in the week ending August 23.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Aug 31	  Aug 23</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     120.1	   120.1</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   16.9	    16.7</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
